,30.0,1989,70,95,22],[31068,29.3,1963,68,99,19],[31069,29.8,1963,68,98,21]],"links":[["Marinette County in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/wisconsin/marinette-county"],["ARC or PLC in Marinette County","/arc-plc/wisconsin/marinette-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 16 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and January to February came in under 90% of normal in 37 of those 75 years. In 2025, September to October and October to November each came in at 45% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 30167 had its driest year in 1976, at 63% of normal.</p>"}
